{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/extras/5df7d022e89fcb8f0930657fd1baf84c.avif?t=1759302753\" width=1560 height=368 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MICROGAME FRENZY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MicroWorks</strong> lumps players together in the Nexus - a central hub comprised of small game towers, where players compete against each other in a series of fast paced microgames designed to challenge your speed and wit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points and climb the scoreboard by successfully performing microgames faster and better than your opponents. Killer turrets, obstacle courses, trivia riddles, even simple tasks such as grouping up with a friend will prove challenging as you find your foes pushing you away from the objective. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOSS STAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game ends in a <strong>boss stage</strong> - a bigger and longer minigame, taking place in its own special stage. Farm score in a last-ditch effort to shift the tides of war and come out on top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost hunting, kart racing, and even wild west standoffs are only some examples from our diverse pool of options. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Microgames</strong> - An abundance of ways to get tested in the Nexus, with nearly <strong>150</strong> total microgame variations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Boss Stages</strong> - Turn the tides in the climactic finale of each game, with <strong>15</strong> different boss stages available. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Gamemodes</strong> - Try out various gamemodes (along with team variants) such as <strong>Scorematch</strong>, where players compete to get the highest score, or <strong>Survival</strong>, where failure means death, and the last player standing wins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Modifiers</strong> - Stay on your toes as each game will surprise you with different random modifiers, whether it be the <strong>Arguments</strong>, <strong>Special Rounds</strong>, or else...? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Up To 16 Players In A Match</strong> - These robots are wildin'. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Steam Integration</strong> - Unlock achievements, reach new high scores and climb the leaderboards with our rich steam integration. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ef58919bb41f0a435fb37ab7489fb8924288421c.jpg","localized_name":"Look Ma, I Won!","name":"Look Ma, I Won!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/ef58919bb41f0a435fb37ab7489fb8924288421c.jpg"},{"icon":"fe680ff6c1202b8941aa446033627d8503050e8d.jpg","localized_name":"Microgame Novice","name":"Microgame Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/fe680ff6c1202b8941aa446033627d8503050e8d.jpg"},{"icon":"9680608ff889bb0fe79cb8713429350cbc3e3aa0.jpg","localized_name":"Microgame Pro","name":"Microgame Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/9680608ff889bb0fe79cb8713429350cbc3e3aa0.jpg"},{"icon":"f2355d83d755c7c0e0ec592dde47de4e5f8c3ee1.jpg","localized_name":"Microgame Master","name":"Microgame Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/f2355d83d755c7c0e0ec592dde47de4e5f8c3ee1.jpg"},{"icon":"9943c2db4fbf877c28253c1059913f27f9f88871.jpg","localized_name":"MicroGod","name":"MicroGod","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/9943c2db4fbf877c28253c1059913f27f9f88871.jpg"},{"icon":"77534bbea0e3e0fb555c729df497d3e37b969aa4.jpg","localized_name":"Pointmatch Novice","name":"Pointmatch Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/77534bbea0e3e0fb555c729df497d3e37b969aa4.jpg"},{"icon":"f4ade5cec5656a28e166d6c020e7acd95073149e.jpg","localized_name":"Pointmatch Pro","name":"Pointmatch Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/f4ade5cec5656a28e166d6c020e7acd95073149e.jpg"},{"icon":"96069b0ac0010ec79e03f77a7147aef19299887e.jpg","localized_name":"Pointmatch Master","name":"Pointmatch Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/96069b0ac0010ec79e03f77a7147aef19299887e.jpg"},{"icon":"f45cdceaddd67c1746b34e14b310c022b99b5cf3.jpg","localized_name":"Scorematch Novice","name":"Scorematch Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/f45cdceaddd67c1746b34e14b310c022b99b5cf3.jpg"},{"icon":"d1035c427ed4f8745561b0f22f8a250a57bf3dc9.jpg","localized_name":"Scorematch Pro","name":"Scorematch Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1233410/d1035c427ed4f8745561b0f22f8a250a57bf3dc9.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1233410?t=1759302753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759302753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759302753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759302753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Party Pass DLC</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/extras/7daec48c3d6b23196a1418b2e65543d5.avif?t=1759302753\" width=1560 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximize your experience with exclusive customization options and gameplay features, all a part of the <strong>MicroWorks Party Pass!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Workshop Cosmetics</strong> - Gain access to hundreds of user contributed cosmetics from the Steam Workshop, or create your own using ANY 3D model. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Custom Emotes</strong> - Upload your own custom images to use as emotes, and customize your emote wheel in any way you'd like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Private Hosting</strong> - Get access to all server creation settings, including the ability to host hidden or password protected servers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mutators</strong> - Customize your game settings, from adjusting the amount of microgames and speedups, to specifically excluding any microgames/boss stages that you desire to leave out. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Boss Rush</strong> - No microgames, only an onslaught of boss stages - get access to the exclusive Boss Rush gamemode that sees you battle through a series of boss stages one after another. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/extras/5df7d022e89fcb8f0930657fd1baf84c.avif?t=1759302753\" width=1560 height=368 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MICROGAME FRENZY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MicroWorks</strong> lumps players together in the Nexus - a central hub comprised of small game towers, where players compete against each other in a series of fast paced microgames designed to challenge your speed and wit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points and climb the scoreboard by successfully performing microgames faster and better than your opponents. Killer turrets, obstacle courses, trivia riddles, even simple tasks such as grouping up with a friend will prove challenging as you find your foes pushing you away from the objective. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOSS STAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game ends in a <strong>boss stage</strong> - a bigger and longer minigame, taking place in its own special stage. Farm score in a last-ditch effort to shift the tides of war and come out on top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost hunting, kart racing, and even wild west standoffs are only some examples from our diverse pool of options. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Microgames</strong> - An abundance of ways to get tested in the Nexus, with nearly <strong>150</strong> total microgame variations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Boss Stages</strong> - Turn the tides in the climactic finale of each game, with <strong>15</strong> different boss stages available. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Gamemodes</strong> - Try out various gamemodes (along with team variants) such as <strong>Scorematch</strong>, where players compete to get the highest score, or <strong>Survival</strong>, where failure means death, and the last player standing wins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Modifiers</strong> - Stay on your toes as each game will surprise you with different random modifiers, whether it be the <strong>Arguments</strong>, <strong>Special Rounds</strong>, or else...? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Up To 16 Players In A Match</strong> - These robots are wildin'. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Steam Integration</strong> - Unlock achievements, reach new high scores and climb the leaderboards with our rich steam integration. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Agiriko"],"dlc":[2355460],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1233410/header.jpg?t=1759302753","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1233410/571371/8e4854f9170126a01359c689ecbf0339a664f7a5/1751207597/dash_av1.mpd?t=1685033418","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1233410/571371/8e4854f9170126a01359c689ecbf0339a664f7a5/1751207597/dash_h264.mpd?t=1685033418","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1233410/571371/8e4854f9170126a01359c689ecbf0339a664f7a5/1751207597/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1685033418","id":256948870,"name":"MicroWorks - F2P Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto